{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "98aa3492b0c4984fdae92e29fae39f7bfe16ce3686b7c568fde0a219056b96f2", "ja": "（歩は出演する映画に向けて、演技のレッスン中。\n裏社会で活躍する雀士、リイチを演じているが……）", "zh": "（步正在为即将出演的电影上演技课。\n她饰演的是活跃于黑社会的雀士理一……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8b824f1f63324bbb1d67c2bf862c4fa99f3dd8e80b7d9de6415ab4179359666f", "ja": "どうしたんだ、歩？　納得いっていない表情だな。\nそんなに悪いお芝居だとは思わなかったけど。", "zh": "怎么了，步？看起来一副不太满意的表情啊。\n我倒没觉得演得有那么糟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cce4abb781e09b8246bb22e32765c2da9c9a046a412f0f9ed66d0e625e93c867", "ja": "ん～……芝居っていうか、アタシの動き？　ここの回想\nシーンって、カッコよく牌を切るのが見せ場でしょ？", "zh": "嗯～……与其说是演技，不如说是我的动作？这里的回忆场景，亮点就是帅气地打出麻将牌吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dfd1f625c84daa9dd923e2b75c463fbae8a376f39ece7c033340947e5fb04977", "ja": "けど、イマイチ決めきれてないっていうか……\nもっとこう……ビシッと打たないと、カッコ悪くない？", "zh": "不过，总觉得还没完全做到位……该怎么说呢……要是不更利落地打出去，会不会很难看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1004_p", "source_sha256": "be7e7564cec55332085e30425765d4cc8ff4bdd33d0fed2f695756a1957158bc", "ja": "そう言われると、確かに……\nギャンブラーとしてのリイチの、見せ場だもんな。", "zh": "这样一说，确实……  \n这可是作为赌徒的リイチ大显身手的机会啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "84ffc0cc9927a08f56987f43c5be0686cba058afee320a7812cbed53a2707729", "ja": "そう！　リイチだったら、もっとバシッと\n決めると思うんだけど……そうだ！", "zh": "对！要是换作理一的话，我觉得他肯定能更干脆利落地搞定……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1006_p", "source_sha256": "72e99fb69c920a1e9bd59cb5367593d0a62d04fc5130b3f9a40c6a0a608a62e4", "ja": "何か、いい案が思いついたのか？", "zh": "你是想到什么好主意了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3e7ae8b5cb0b74cc55862d7c9dcf27a2a00e190ec4a53be024e24d0522c80de0", "ja": "へへ、ちょっとね！　まあ見ててよ、\n次のレッスンまでに、しっかり仕上げてくるからさ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，算是吧！你就等着看吧，\n下次练习前，我一定会好好准备完的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a8b624ffda4be211b647612609e74e9705d7ce7fdf31deadd5dfe433c721de75", "ja": "（そして、翌週。歩の動きは見違えるほど良くなり、\n凄腕の雀士らしさを発揮していた！）", "zh": "（然后，到了第二周。步的动作变得好得判若两人，充分展现出了高手雀士的风范！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dbb93683bffa107c8efe7346085876df79933cc2d33df129a18e0a25d5420c2a", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}！\nどう？　今日のアタシ、いい感じだったでしょ？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n怎么样？今天的我，表现得很不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1010_p", "source_sha256": "26d48797efddff8fcc4bf0a471df77ac996c2f44e122c266defbdca86a51fbdb", "ja": "ああ！　所作がよくなったおかげで、裏社会で\n活躍してたっていう設定に、説得力が増してたな。", "zh": "啊！多亏你的举止变得更好了，“曾经活跃于黑社会”这个设定也更有说服力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a6870a093774beb3fc8d831d69852834a193c2370fb5073b29488bf05ca92d9f", "ja": "けど、どうやったんだ？\n麻雀の打ち方を、誰かに教えてもらったとか？", "zh": "不过，你是怎么做到的？\n难道有人教了你打麻将？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b0c725ea6ecccc23913f1b529670d96b610451ac6ac6672b73c8280d3b4035ad", "ja": "正解！　先週ここで話しながら、思い出したんだ。\nアタシの大学に、麻雀サークルがあったなって！", "zh": "答对了！上周在这里聊天的时候，我想起来了。我大学里有个麻将社团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b30821473fc09a02a6fa2a0576b6ae67a9fc6e3cd96c041abd2e90899a4633f1", "ja": "それで「しばらく通わせて欲しい」って、お願いしに\n行ったんだけど……みんなホントいい人ばっかりでさ！", "zh": "所以我就去拜托他们，说“想去那里一段时间”……结果大家真的都是大好人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "684fafcc9979895a7089749596f9f077c563a0146a1f09c3c624162d117d2860", "ja": "部員でもない、初対面のアタシに優しく\n教えてくれて……おかげで助かったよ♪", "zh": "我既不是社团成员，和他们也是第一次见面，他们却还是很温柔地教我……多亏了他们，我才得救了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1031629f2dec8aa3fd0d9e2508a2c24702fd0b2ee33f5ea6cd315069243b6b6e", "ja": "なるほど……けど、飛び入りで参加したのか？\nサークルの中に、知り合いがいるとかではなく……。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，你是临时加入的？\n不是因为社团里有认识的人……对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a0d1c0854ae68dc8dc85794b0c0f455f6857926f639526f587debf0677b3d027", "ja": "うん。目的は違うけど、麻雀を\n打てるようになりたいって気持ちは本気だったし。", "zh": "嗯。虽然目的不太一样，不过\n想学会打麻将的心情可是认真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "560daf3a35fae37068f63c102c9ca213fbefa9e90f53eb4ba155bead35861fdc", "ja": "それに、麻雀のことがちょっとわかってきたら、\nリイチの凄さもわかったっていうか……。", "zh": "而且，稍微了解麻将之后，我也算是明白了立直的厉害之处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ad18139297471f4afe9f0eab432e1c01c85aed287a0df7818f7c9fa4da840fe0", "ja": "それは何よりだ。もしかして、歩自身も麻雀が\n面白くなってきた感じか？", "zh": "那太好了。难道说，连步自己也开始觉得麻将有意思了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "59d42097fcbeb55d5c54defa957a6f97b9e3e17082f028f66a01521734e6c8c3", "ja": "うん！　サークルの人たちも「いつでも来てね」って\n言ってくれたし、また行こうかなって思ってるよ！", "zh": "嗯！社团的人也对我说“随时欢迎你来”，所以我想着要不要再去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a895cf94eeda880932ff12df94b15e5153441d17919344fa24ac6f968e0127b3", "ja": "あとは劇場でも、誰かと打てたら……あっ。\nそういえば、このみさん得意だったよね……？", "zh": "要是也能在剧场找个人一起打的话……啊。说起来，木实姐很擅长来着……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0434_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7dbc669707faf20503638dc97c44f06d78442e494f8e98e5f21a8c2e6f2e47c8", "ja": "（演技力向上のためとはいえ、さすがの行動力だな。\nこれは、撮影本番が楽しみだ）", "zh": "（虽说是为了提高演技，这行动力还真是惊人啊。真期待正式拍摄那天啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
